803..961 Comment "//! [Plotkin-2002-notions_computation_determine_monads]: https://doi.org/10.1007/3-540-45931-6_24 \"Plotkin and Power, Notions of computation determine monads\""
963..1028 Comment "/// Programs over an integer state: a read hands the state to its"
1029..1097 Comment "/// continuation, and a store the next store overwrites is no store."
